    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26042" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατείχ-ισμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>place walled off and fortified,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.34
			</span></i>; <i>cross-wall,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.60
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wall between two places</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				421.46
			</span></i> (Thermon, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				8.34.9
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>wall of partition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMeretr.</u>
				11.4
			</span></i>.</div>
